    "enUS": {
      "description": "It's too late for me, stranger. I'm not going to be making it out of this one. Take my crest to the Knight Commander. Warn him...\r\n\r\n<Ryan's eyes begin to glaze over as he mumbles to himself.>\r\n\r\nI'm sorry. I should have come home. Abigail...",
      "dialogue": {
        "1979ba0ebdc749d263ca": "Ever dutiful till the end. Thank you for bringing this to me, $c.",
        "de8ba1d9326bebd0e1c5": "Did you find the Marshal?"
      },
      "summary": "Return Marshal Ryan's crest to Knight Commander Demar Brant in Farholde Keep.",
      "title": "Dying Wish",
      "translationMetadata": {
